(DocChat Technical Documentation. DocChat is an advanced Retrieval-Augmented Generation chatbot system designed for documents. It uses sentence-transformers with the all-MiniLM-L6-v2 embedding model running 100 percent locally. ChromaDB is employed as the vector store for nearest neighbor semantic similarity queries. For language generation, DocChat connects to Google Gemini 1.5 Flash via streaming Server-Sent Events. Metadata such as document ID, file size, chunk counts, and page numbers are persisted in SQLite using SQLAlchemy.) Tj
ET
endstream
